  "content": "\n\n<p>實驗性生物</p>\n<p><strong>即將推出另一項實驗</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>*這是我的實驗性專案，尚未平衡</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>實體（開發中）</p>\n<p>腐化騎士</p>\n<p>450hp</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1023/823/knight.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"406\" height=\"162\"></p>\n<p>Furens</p>\n<p>350hp</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1023/825/furious-1.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"344\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p>Gycklare</p>\n<p>250 - 1000hp（視階段數值而定）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1023/827/jester_knight.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"391\" height=\"159\"></p>\n<p>觀察者</p>\n<p>450hp</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1023/826/observer.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"376\" height=\"153\"></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<blockquote>\n<p>測試用實體</p>\n<p>冰霜守護者</p>\n<p>創造之手</p>\n<p>矮人傀儡</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>",
